Package: kubui
Version: 0.1.0-1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Dylan <dylan@example.com>
Installed-Size: 16843
Depends: python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1, podman, curl, ca-certificates, tar, gzip
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/dylan/kubui
Description: GUI tool for managing local Kubernetes cluster resources
 kubui is a desktop application that provides a native GUI for managing
 local Kubernetes clusters. It detects, installs, and manages CLI tools
 including minikube, helm, podman, and kubectl, all from a single window.
 .
 This package downloads required CLI tools (kubectl, helm, minikube)
 during post-installation and declares podman as a system dependency. Run `kubui` to launch the
 GUI or `kubui --check` to print tool status.
